This means that the file in .Data containing "longer4hmm1"
(or "mydata"?) has been corrupted.  If you run 2 Splus sessions
at once, both writing into the same .Data directory, this could happen.

Has this happened repeatedly?

You should be able to clean it up by doing
        > rm(longer4hmm1)
        > rm(mydata)

