as.numeric() is the wrong command: it extracts the internal coding of the 
factor.

> TC <- scan()
1: $25.00  $25.00  $93.00  $87.00  $21.00  $102.00 $110.00 $140.00 $147.95 
$71.00

11:
> TC <- factor(TC)
> as.numeric(TC)

 [1] 6 6 9 8 5 1 2 3 4 7
> as.character(TC)

 [1] "$25.00"  "$25.00"  "$93.00"  "$87.00"  "$21.00"  "$102.00" "$110.00"
 [8] "$140.00" "$147.95" "$71.00"
> TC2 <- gsub("^\\$", "", as.character(TC))
> TC2

 [1] "25.00"  "25.00"  "93.00"  "87.00"  "21.00"  "102.00" "110.00" "140.00"
 [9] "147.95" "71.00"
> sum(as.numeric(TC2))

[1] 821.95

