Re: errors when generating large numbers of plots in 
S+

 

I've had similar errors generating large numbers of plots from 
S+ (>100). There seems to be an internal graphics buffer that saturates and 
causes dramas.

 

Try using the devices "wmf.graph" and "pdf.graph". These seem 
far more robust than "graphsheet" for large numbers of plots and have that 
advantage that they don't need to be run from the GUI (i.e. work in console 
mode which is far less resource intense).

 

As far as getting these images into Powerpoint, I would write 
a script in Visual Basic for Applications (VBA). This is likely to be a 
better solution and give you more control over formatting etc.

 

